<section class="r-bridge">
  <div class="container r-bridge-inner">
    <div class="r-bridge-copy">
      <h2>You can buy every tool on this page and still not get found.</h2>
      <p>
        A CRM does not rank you. A dialer does not answer the question a person
        typed into Google at 9pm. The site is the part of the stack most
        agencies keep putting off, so we made it the fast part.
      </p>
      <p class="r-bridge-terms">
        From $499. Live in a couple weeks. You own the site and the domain, and
        there is no long-term contract.
      </p>
      <div class="r-bridge-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-ink" href="/templates/">See the templates</a>
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="/#pricing">What it costs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .r-bridge {
    background: var(--cream-deep);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 72px 0;
  }
  .r-bridge-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .r-bridge-copy {
    max-width: 640px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: "Unbounded", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .r-bridge-copy p {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #3a3a3a;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .r-bridge-terms {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .r-bridge-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .r-bridge {
      padding: 56px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
